<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-114.3-dg-storage-handling-incident-and-regulatory-compliance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3609" name="W3609. DG Storage Compliance &amp; Fixed-Site Risk Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DG storage design/change (DC, store); inspection cycle; incident
Frequency: Per site + ongoing inspection
Volume: 200 stores + 4 DCs with DG storage areas (paint/chemical cages)
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, HSE (links to VS-24.3), Facilities (links to VS-20.3/VS-07.2), DC Operations (links to VS-04), Store Operations (links to VS-07), BFP/Fire Safety, Quality (links to VS-31)
Source: workflow W3609 — DG Storage Compliance &amp; Fixed-Site Risk Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3609_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3609_Lane1" name="DG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3609_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3609_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3609_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3609_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3609_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3609_Start3" name="DG storage design/change (DC, store); inspection cycle; incident">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3609_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3609_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE define DG fixed-site storage compliance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE define DG fixed-site storage compliance standards (in partnership with VS-24.3): segregated storage (incompatible separation), ventilation, spill containment, fire suppression (links to VS-24.3 BFP), temperature control, quantity limits per area, signage, and emergency equipment (eyewash, spill kit); align to DENR ECC and BFP Fire Code
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3609_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3609_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3609_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE/Facilities implement and maintain DG storage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE/Facilities implement and maintain DG storage compliance across DCs and stores: storage layout, ventilation/suppression integrity, signage/equipment, quantity monitoring, and reconciliation to the hazmat inventory (W3595); resolve deficiencies
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE / Facilities
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per site + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3609_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3609_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3609_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE inspect DG storage compliance on a schedule…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE inspect DG storage compliance on a schedule (DC monthly, store quarterly per VS-24.3 cadence), manage findings to closure, and report fixed-site DG compliance and risk to governance (W3616); coordinate the interface with VS-24.3 (worker-safety storage) to avoid duplication
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3609_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3609_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3609_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3609_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-573 (ensure controlled execution — DG Storage/Handling Safety, Incident Response &amp; Regulatory Compliance (PA-114.3).) | - operational: standards and inspection; operational: quantity monitoring
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3609_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3609_Annotation8" targetRef="W3609_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3609_Flow10" sourceRef="W3609_Start3" targetRef="W3609_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3609_Flow11" sourceRef="W3609_Task4" targetRef="W3609_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3609_Flow12" sourceRef="W3609_Task5" targetRef="W3609_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3609_Flow13" sourceRef="W3609_Task6" targetRef="W3609_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
