    <bpmn:process id="W_W3610" name="W3610. DG Handling Procedures, PPE &amp; Worker Safety" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Role/task involving DG handling; PPE cycle; incident
Frequency: Per task + ongoing
Volume: DG-handling workers across DCs, stores, ecommerce, drivers
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, HSE (links to VS-24), DC Operations (links to VS-04), Store Operations (links to VS-07), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Logistics (links to VS-06), Occupational Health (links to VS-83), Procurement (links to VS-34)
Source: workflow W3610 — DG Handling Procedures, PPE &amp; Worker Safety</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3610_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3610_Lane1" name="DG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3610_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3610_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3610_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3610_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3610_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3610_Start3" name="Role/task involving DG handling; PPE cycle; incident">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3610_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3610_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE define DG handling procedures and PPE…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE define DG handling procedures and PPE standards by task (receive, store, pick, pack, ship, display, cut/mix paint, deliver): safe-lift/transfer, decanting/mixing, no-smoking/no-ignition, spill first-response, exposure first-aid (per SDS W3595); specify PPE (gloves, goggles, respirator, apron) by chemical/task
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3610_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3610_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3610_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE/Operations implement handling procedures and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE/Operations implement handling procedures and PPE: train workers (links to W3597), provision and maintain PPE, post handling instructions and SDS access (links to VS-24.3), supervise compliance, and manage exposure monitoring/health surveillance for high-exposure roles (links to VS-83)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE / Operations / Occupational Health
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3610_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3610_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3610_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE audit handling/PPE compliance, manage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE audit handling/PPE compliance, manage findings, track exposure/incident data (links to W3613), and feed corrective action to procedures/training/PPE; report worker-safety DG posture to governance (W3616) and occupational health (links to VS-83)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3610_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3610_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3610_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3610_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-573 (ensure controlled execution — DG Storage/Handling Safety, Incident Response &amp; Regulatory Compliance (PA-114.3).) | - operational: PPE, monitoring, and health surveillance; operational: supervision and training
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3610_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3610_Annotation8" targetRef="W3610_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3610_Flow10" sourceRef="W3610_Start3" targetRef="W3610_Task4" />
