    <bpmn:process id="W_W3611" name="W3611. DG Spill Response, Containment &amp; Remediation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DG spill/leak at a fixed site (DC, store, ecommerce pack station)
Frequency: Occasional
Volume: DG spill events
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, HSE (links to VS-24/VS-26.2), Site Operations, Hazmat Contractor, Occupational Health (links to VS-83), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Environmental/Sustainability (links to VS-25), DENR-EMB
Source: workflow W3611 — DG Spill Response, Containment &amp; Remediation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3611_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3611_Lane1" name="Site Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3611_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3611_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3611_Lane2" name="DG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3611_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3611_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3611_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3611_Start4" name="DG spill/leak at a fixed site (DC, store, ecommerce pack station)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3611_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3611_Task5" name="Site staff/HSE respond to the spill: immediate safety (isolate, evacuate if…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Site staff/HSE respond to the spill: immediate safety (isolate, evacuate if needed, PPE), first response per SDS (W3595) and spill kit, containment (booms/pads/drain cover to prevent environmental release), and notification to DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE; engage hazmat contractor for significant spills
Responsible (R): Site Staff / HSE / DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): Site Manager / VP Legal
Duration: Immediate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3611_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3611_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3611_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE/Hazmat Contractor manage clean-up and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE/Hazmat Contractor manage clean-up and remediation: recover/absorb the spilled material, decontaminate the area, manage the waste as hazardous (W3612), restore storage/handling, and conduct environmental assessment if release occurred; coordinate with DENR-EMB for environmental release (links to VS-25)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE / Hazmat Contractor
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3611_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3611_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3611_Task7" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE investigate the spill root-cause (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE investigate the spill root-cause (links to VS-24/VS-21), document (W3613/W3600), and implement corrective/preventive action (training W3597, packaging W3598, storage W3609, procedures W3610); report to governance (W3616)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE / Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Post-event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3611_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3611_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3611_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3611_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-573 (ensure controlled execution — DG Storage/Handling Safety, Incident Response &amp; Regulatory Compliance (PA-114.3).) | - operational: containment and drain protection; operational: spill plan and hazmat contractor on retainer
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
