    <bpmn:process id="W_W3612" name="W3612. DG Hazardous Waste Transport, Disposal &amp; DENR-EMB Manifest" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DG waste generation (spills W3611, expired/returned DG, contaminated material, empty containers); disposal cycle
Frequency: Per waste-stream + scheduled pickup
Volume: Hazardous waste across 200 stores + 4 DCs
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Sustainability
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, Sustainability/Environmental (links to VS-25), Waste Mgmt (links to VS-73), HSE (links to VS-24), DENR-EMB-accredited Transporter/Treater, Logistics (links to VS-06), Finance (links to VS-17)
Source: workflow W3612 — DG Hazardous Waste Transport, Disposal &amp; DENR-EMB Manifest</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3612_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3612_Lane1" name="DG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3612_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3612_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3612_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3612_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3612_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3612_Start3" name="DG waste generation (spills W3611, expired/returned DG, contaminated material, empty…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3612_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3612_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Sustainability classify and accumulate hazardous…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Sustainability classify and accumulate hazardous waste per DENR-EMB (RA 6969): waste classification (hazardous waste category per DAO 2013-22), accumulation/storage at site (satellite/central, within the 90-day on-site accumulation limit), labeling/marking, and the waste-profile record; manage waste streams (expired DG, spill residue, contaminated packaging, used oils/solvents)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Sustainability / Waste Mgmt
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CSO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3612_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3612_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3612_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Waste Mgmt arrange hazardous-waste transport and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Waste Mgmt arrange hazardous-waste transport and disposal with DENR-EMB-accredited transporter and treater (TSD facility): the DENR-EMB hazardous-waste transport manifest (4-part manifest per RA 6969), transport compliance (W3602/W3603), the treatment/disposal certificate (cradle-to-grave), and the chain-of-custody
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Waste Mgmt / Transporter
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CSO
Duration: Per pickup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3612_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3612_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3612_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Sustainability maintain the hazardous-waste…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Sustainability maintain the hazardous-waste register and DENR-EMB reporting (annual hazardous-waste generation/disposal report, registration as generator, manifest reconciliation), align to circular economy/waste-reduction (links to VS-73), and report to governance (W3616) and ESG (links to VS-25.3)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Sustainability
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CSO
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3612_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3612_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3612_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
