Volume: DG incidents/near-misses
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, HSE (links to VS-24), Audit (links to VS-21), Legal (links to VS-100), Compliance (links to VS-22), Risk (links to VS-21.2), Insurance (links to VS-26), Occupational Health (links to VS-83)
Source: workflow W3613 — DG Incident Investigation, Reporting &amp; Regulatory Notification</bpmn:documentation>
