      <bpmn:userTask id="W3614_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Facilities/Compliance manage DG-related site…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Facilities/Compliance manage DG-related site permits: DENR-EMB Environmental Compliance Certificate (ECC) / Permit to Operate (PTO) for hazardous-material storage, BFP Fire Safety Inspection Certificate (FSIC) for flammable storage, LGU permits (links to VS-76), and DOLE OSH compliance; secure for new sites and renew on cycle
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Facilities / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Per permit + cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3614_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3614_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3614_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Facilities ensure Fire Code (BFP) compliance for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Facilities ensure Fire Code (BFP) compliance for DG storage: fire-load calculation, fire suppression/extinguisher adequacy (links to W3609), alarm/detection, exits/egress, occupancy limits, and the annual fire safety inspection; manage deficiencies
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Facilities / BFP
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per site + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3614_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3614_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3614_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Compliance maintain the DG permit register and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Compliance maintain the DG permit register and renewal calendar, manage inspections/findings (links to W3600), and report DG permitting/Fire Code compliance to governance (W3616); coordinate multi-site rollouts (200 sites)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3614_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
