    <bpmn:process id="W_W3615" name="W3615. DG Insurance, Liability &amp; Risk Transfer" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Insurance renewal (links to VS-26); DG risk change; incident/claim
Frequency: Annual + on change/claim
Volume: DG insurance coverage and claims
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Risk &amp; Insurance
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, Risk &amp; Insurance (links to VS-26), Legal (links to VS-100), Finance (links to VS-17/VS-18), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), Procurement (links to VS-34), Broker/Insurer
Source: workflow W3615 — DG Insurance, Liability &amp; Risk Transfer</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3615_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3615_Lane1" name="DG">
