      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3615_Start3" name="Insurance renewal (links to VS-26); DG risk change; incident/claim">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3615_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3615_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Risk &amp; Insurance define DG insurance and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Risk &amp; Insurance define DG insurance and risk-transfer requirements: property (DG storage fire/explosion), marine/cargo (DG transit links to VS-26), public/product liability (DG exposure to customers/public), environmental liability (pollution), and motor (DG carriage); align to the corporate insurance program (links to VS-26.3)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Risk &amp; Insurance
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3615_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3615_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3615_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Risk &amp; Insurance/Logistics manage DG risk transfer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Risk &amp; Insurance/Logistics manage DG risk transfer to carriers/3PLs/vendors: contractual liability allocation (carrier indemnity W3601, vendor obligation W3599), certificates of insurance from DG carriers/contractors, and subrogation/recovery (links to VS-90); ensure coverage adequacy and limits
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Risk &amp; Insurance / Legal / Logistics
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Per contract + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3615_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3615_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3615_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Risk &amp; Insurance manage DG claims (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Risk &amp; Insurance manage DG claims (links to VS-26/W853): incident notification, claim filing, adjuster coordination, recovery/subrogation, and settlement; track DG loss experience and feed to underwriting/renewal and to governance (W3616) and risk (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Risk &amp; Insurance / Legal
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Per claim + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3615_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3615_End7" name="Complete">
