        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-573 (ensure controlled execution — DG Storage/Handling Safety, Incident Response &amp; Regulatory Compliance (PA-114.3).) | - operational: exposure modeling and adequate limits; operational: legal-reviewed terms and COI discipline
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Risk &amp; Insurance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
