    <bpmn:process id="W_W3616" name="W3616. DG Compliance Analytics, Loss-Event Review &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; governance/risk cycle
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: DG program and loss-event data
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, BI (links to VS-28.1), HSE (links to VS-24), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Audit (links to VS-21), Risk (links to VS-21.2), ExCo (links to VS-33.2), Board/Risk Committee (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3616 — DG Compliance Analytics, Loss-Event Review &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3616_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3616_Lane1" name="DG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3616_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3616_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3616_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3616_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3616_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3616_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; governance/risk cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3616_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3616_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/BI define and instrument DG program metrics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/BI define and instrument DG program metrics: compliance audit scores, classification/SDS coverage, training currency, transport/carrier compliance, ecommerce ship-eligibility coverage, incidents/near-misses/loss events, permit currency, insurance loss ratio, and DG cost (premium, remediation, claims)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / BI
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3616_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3616_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3616_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer conduct loss-event review and trend analysis…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer conduct loss-event review and trend analysis: incident root-cause patterns, recurring carriers/sites/SKUs/categories, leading indicators (near-misses, findings), and emerging risk (regulatory change W3596); produce the DG program dashboard and risk view
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / BI / Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Monthly + quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3616_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3616_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3616_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer report DG posture, loss events, risk, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer report DG posture, loss events, risk, and continuous-improvement initiatives to the risk committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-36) and ExCo (links to VS-33.2), drive corrective/preventive action across classification/packaging/training/transport/storage, and feed learnings to standards (W3598) and program strategy (W3593)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3616_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3616_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3616_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3616_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-573 (ensure controlled execution — DG Storage/Handling Safety, Incident Response &amp; Regulatory Compliance (PA-114.3).) | - operational: leading indicators (near-miss, findings); operational: governance accountability and tracked CAPA
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
